|------|------|-----------|-----------|----------|---------|
| Qwen3.5-9B-UD-Q4_K_XL | CUDA | 92.5% | 65.3% | 96.7% | 无 |
| LLaMA3-8B-Instruct | CUDA | 88.2% | 71.4% | 95.1% | 无 |
| Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_XL | CUDA | 85.7% | 82.6% | 93.4% | 无 |
| Mistral-7B-v0.3 | Vulkan | 78.3% | 88.5% | 90.2% | 低 |

