## 推荐使用场景

### 1. 数学推理任务

**推荐模型**: Qwen3.5-9B-UD-Q4_K_XL (CUDA版本)

```bash
curl http://localhost:8401/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"model": "Qwen3.5-9B-UD-Q4_K_XL", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "计算复杂数学问题"}]}'
```

### 2. 编程辅助任务

**推荐模型**: LLaMA3-8B-Instruct (CUDA版本)

```bash
curl http://localhost:8402/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"model": "LLaMA3-8B-Instruct", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "代码优化建议"}]}'
```

### 3. 运维自动化任务

**推荐模型**: Qwen3.5-9B-UD-Q4_K_XL (CUDA版本)

```bash
curl http://localhost:8401/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"model": "Qwen3.5-9B-UD-Q4_K_XL", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "服务器故障排查"}]}'
```

### 4. 文本理解任务

**推荐模型**: Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_XL (CUDA版本)

```bash
curl http://localhost:8403/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"model": "Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_XL", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "文档分析"}]}'
```

